<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>#(title)</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css">
  <script>
    function setUrl() {
      document.getElementById('url').value = window.location.href;
    }
  </script>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>#(title)</h1>
  <h3><strong>Character Details:</strong></h3>
  <table border="1">
    <tr>
      <th>Name</th>
      <td>#(characterName)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <th>Gender</th>
      <td>#(characterGender)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <th>Fighting Specialty</th>
      <td>#(fightingSpecialty)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <th>Armor Class</th>
      <td>#(armorClass)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <th>Home Planet</th>
      <td>#(homePlanet)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <th>Weapon</th>
      <td>#(weapon)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <th>Money</th>
      <td>#(money)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <th>Inventory</th>
      <td>#(inventory)</td>
    </tr>
  </table>
  <br>
  <p>You hurriedly say "NO! Wait! Check my account!"</p>
  <p>"What? Are you being rich with me, #(characterName)?"</p>
  <p>"No no no not at all! Please check!"</p>
  <p>Him and a guard leaves, and hover in a terminal.</p>
  <br>
  <p>"I do not believe this. There is something wrong with the system"</p>
  <p>"No! Honest! It's real money!"</p>
  <p>Him and the guard go into the files and history of the transactions on your account.</p>
  <p>They spot a donation from a while ago titled 'Present from your cousin, frank'</p>
  <br>
  <p>"But you didn't use any of it when buying your supplies? Or to bribe guards? Why?"</p>
  <p>"I didn't need it, did I?"</p>
  <p>The guards stumble on your response. They look at each other, look at you, shrug, and walk out of the room.</p>
  <br>
  <br>
  <p>A new set of guards take you from the golden room, and throw you in an imperial hovercraft.</p>
  <p>You are whisked above the stadium, watching as fans pour out of it like ants in a pryclogenic protein farm.</p>
  <p>You suddenly have your head covered with a black bag as your eyesight gets whisked away.</p>
  <p>You feel and hear a loud thud on your skull as you are knocked out cold.</p>
  <br>
  <p>...</p>
  <br>
  <p>You regain consciousness as you feel your stomach and arms on cold marble. You open your eyes to see blackness still, with a raging headache.</p>
  <p>The bag is whisked off of your head, and directly in front of you is a magnificently ordained marble and gold room. In the center of it is the largest throne you have ever seen, gilded with minerals.</p>
  <p>Yellow and gold lasers shoot out of the top, and fall like water into receptacles on either side of the arms, crackling with a similar brimstone noise you heard earlier.</p>
  <p>In the center of the room is a pool of water embedded in the floor, covered with glass. You see it is a shark tank.</p>
  <p>And, of course, the sharks are adorned in legionaire headwear and armor. The headwear has two small stun guns attached to each side of it.</p>
  <p>There are at least fifty sharks in the pool.</p>
  <p>You can taste the air, and can tell you are on a completely different planet. Maybe a moon base, you think as you try to feel how strong the gravity is.</p>
  <br>
  <br>
  <p>As you take all of this in, over the ringing in your ears, you hear a slow clap coming from behind you.</p>
  <p>The Emperor, standing right behind you.</p>
  <p>"Well done. Well done." The bone-chilling voice entails.</p>
  <p>"Is... this your throne room?"</p>
  <p>"It appears to be so, yes," he says as he nods to a guard standing over a control panel.</p>
  <p>The guard hits a button, and the glass above the shark tank opens.</p>
  <br>
  <p>As you turn to look at the tank, you feel an arm grab your shirt from behind and raise you up, your shirt choking you as you are carried to the edge of the shark tank.</p>
  <p>"Your cousin Frank had a wonderful donation history. Nothing to anyone, no charities, no taxes, nothing. Turns out, he is destitute. A slave, like yourself."</p>
  <p>Your face is turning red as you struggle to maintain composure, being held above the shark tank. A stun gun laser fires from a shark, and bounces around the tank for a minute, miraculously hitting nothing but the walls of the aquarium.</p>
  <p>"We knew this in The Winner's Receptacle. We just can't find out how you managed to pull that off. Our systems are supposedly impenetrable."</p>
  <p>You cough, unable to speak.</p>
  <p>"Look, I'll offer you a trade. You keep your life, but you owe indefinite servitude for your grandiose exit. And for killing our most popular gladiator in 300 years.</p>
  <p>However, that shark tank looks quite appealing I know. A life continuing being a slave of mine is not for the faint of heart"</p>
  <br>
  <form action="/secret-form" method="POST" onsubmit="setUrl()">
    <label for="choice">Choice:</label>
    <select id="choice" name="choice" required>
      <option value="" disabled selected></option>
      <option value="option1">Accept the offer</option>
      <option value="option2">Decline violently</option>
    </select>
    <input type="hidden" id="url" name="url">
    <br>
    <br>
    <input type="submit" value="Submit">
  </form>
</body>
</html>